# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Closing cannot begin until Title Review is approved.

---

## Rule 2

All Curative Items must be completed before funding.

---

## Rule 3

Settlement amounts must match the approved Purchase & Sale Agreement.

---

## Rule 4

Payment authorization requires Accounting approval.

---

## Rule 5

Closing documents become read-only after completion.

---

## Rule 6

Every approval is recorded in the audit log.

